// Nymeria HelloX fixture: a 2 x 2 x 2 cube centered on the origin.
//
// Original project content, redistributable with Nymeria. It is the
// HelloOBJ cube expressed in the text DirectX .x frame: left-handed
// positions and normals (Z negated) with clockwise source faces.
// The parser converts it back to Nymeria right-handed counter-clockwise
// geometry, so HelloX and HelloOBJ show the same cube.
//
// Six quads, 24 corners, normals, top-left-origin UVs, and six material
// labels. The TextureFilename is validated but never opened.

xof 0303txt 0032

